window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-011-8dad570735a1f1b2.json"]={sha256:"8dad570735a1f1b23565aed0e4010c6064f1ef749259cf809f6a5d2db646dd39",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-d7f277d87e1f4f91","url":"https://docs.nersc.gov/systems/perlmutter/architecture/","title":"Perlmutter CPU architecture","titleEn":"Perlmutter CPU architecture","publisher":"NERSC","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-011","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-011","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-012","referenceUrls":["https://docs.olcf.ornl.gov/systems/frontier_user_guide.html"],"title":"Frontier MI250X：GPU 封裝與 GCD 身份","titleEn":"Frontier MI250X: packages versus compute dies","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付分區選擇表、常駐生命週期與損益平衡圖；100/140、CPU120/240與k8門檻吻合，版本與回收範圍明確；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver partition choices, residency lifetimes and break-even plots. Verify 100/140, CPU = 120/240 and threshold 8 with explicit versions/retrieval scope. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"建立節點→封裝→GCD三層身份表，為每個工作記可見裝置ID及封裝關聯；32/64重現，八個GCD各有唯一分片，未把總HBM當單一共享空間。","differenceEn":"Build node→package→GCD identities and record visible device plus package for each job. Reproduce 32/64 with unique shards on eight GCDs and no assumption of one pooled HBM space.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["重用k次的裝置路徑T=copy+k×kernel；一次傳輸可攤薄，但僅限輸入不變；合成copy=60毫秒、kernel=4毫秒，k=10與20；CPU每次12毫秒；名義式 60+10*4 = 100 ms；變更式 60+20*4 = 140 ms。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","可見GCD數D=packages×dies；等分N工作後每GCD N/D，不將封裝數當裝置數；合成N=256工作、4封裝×2GCD；另案N=512，所有GCD可用；名義式 256/(4*2) = 32 jobs/GCD；變更式 512/(4*2) = 64 jobs/GCD。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["A device path reused k times costs T=copy+k×kernel; amortization requires unchanged inputs. Synthetic copy 60 ms, kernel 4 ms, k 10 versus 20; CPU = 12 ms per iteration. Nominal 60+10*4 = 100 ms; changed 60+20*4 = 140 ms. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Visible GCD count D=packages×dies; equal shards have N/D work, not N/packages. Synthetic N 256, 4 packages×2 GCD; compare N 512 with every GCD available. Nominal 256/(4*2) = 32 jobs/GCD; changed 512/(4*2) = 64 jobs/GCD. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-021","referenceUrls":["https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-best-practices-guide/"],"title":"CUDA：執行格、區塊與邊界守衛","titleEn":"CUDA: grids, blocks and bounds guards","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付分區選擇表、常駐生命週期與損益平衡圖；100/140、CPU120/240與k8門檻吻合，版本與回收範圍明確；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver partition choices, residency lifetimes and break-even plots. Verify 100/140, CPU = 120/240 and threshold 8 with explicit versions/retrieval scope. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"推導i=blockIdx×blockDim+threadIdx，畫最後區塊有效與無效lane；4/8可重算，所有1000輸出正確且額外槽不修改資料。","differenceEn":"Derive i = blockIdx × blockDim + threadIdx. Mark valid and invalid lanes in the last block. Reproduce 4/8 with 1000 correct outputs and no writes from extra slots.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["重用k次的裝置路徑T=copy+k×kernel；一次傳輸可攤薄，但僅限輸入不變；合成copy=60毫秒、kernel=4毫秒，k=10與20；CPU每次12毫秒；名義式 60+10*4 = 100 ms；變更式 60+20*4 = 140 ms。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","grid=ceil(N/block)，總啟動槽grid×block；僅i\u003cN的執行緒可寫輸出；合成N1000，block256對128，核函數每有效索引寫i²；名義式 ceil(1000/256) = 4 blocks；變更式 ceil(1000/128) = 8 blocks。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["A device path reused k times costs T=copy+k×kernel; amortization requires unchanged inputs. Synthetic copy 60 ms, kernel 4 ms, k 10 versus 20; CPU = 12 ms per iteration. Nominal 60+10*4 = 100 ms; changed 60+20*4 = 140 ms. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","grid=ceil(N/block), launched slots=grid×block; only i\u003cN may write outputs. Synthetic N 1000, block 256 versus 128; each valid index writes i². Nominal ceil(1000/256) = 4 blocks; changed ceil(1000/128) = 8 blocks. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-72e04e73d7a2f0e8","url":"https://docs.olcf.ornl.gov/systems/frontier_user_guide.html","title":"Frontier User Guide","titleEn":"Frontier User Guide","publisher":"Oak Ridge Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-969df2bf493d6959","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-best-practices-guide/","title":"CUDA Best Practices Guide","titleEn":"CUDA Best Practices Guide","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
